OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785246499
OL,3,CResponse to plastic pellet spill not
OL,4,C'met expectations', says shipping
OL,5,Ccompany
OL,7,FA shipping company has said it
OL,8,Frecognises that the speed of the
OL,9,Fresponse to the spillage of millions
OL,10,Fof plastic pellets into the River Tyne
OL,11,F"has not met community expectations".
OL,13,FDanish firm Cadeler owns the vessel
OL,14,F'Wind Orca', which was involved in a
OL,15,Fcollision with another vessel, 'BG
OL,16,FOrange', at the Port of Tyne on Sunday
OL,17,F19 July.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
