OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785246499
OL,3,CResponse to plastic pellet spill not
OL,4,C'met expectations', says shipping
OL,5,Ccompany
OL,7,FA dockside crane collapsed in the
OL,8,Fcollision while millions of 'nurdles'
OL,9,F- small plastic pellets which are
OL,10,Fmelted down to make plastic products -
OL,11,Fescaped from one of the vessels into
OL,12,Fthe Tyne Estuary and then into the
OL,13,FNorth Sea.
OL,15,FFor more than a week, the pellets have
OL,16,Fbeen washing up along the region's
OL,17,Fcoast, prompting warnings of possible
OL,18,Fdangers to wildlife and beachgoers.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785246499
OL,3,CResponse to plastic pellet spill not
OL,4,C'met expectations', says shipping
OL,5,Ccompany
OL,7,FResponse to the spill by the shipping
OL,8,Fcompanies of the vessels involved has
OL,9,Fdrawn criticism by North East Mayor
OL,10,FKim McGuinness, who has said the clean-
OL,11,Fup operation falls to those
OL,12,Forganisations.
OL,14,FIn a letter to, and shared by, the
OL,15,FNorth East Mayor on Monday (27 July),
OL,16,FCadeler's CEO Mikkel Gleerup said he
OL,17,Fshared the "deep concern" about the
OL,18,Fpotential environmental impact of the
OL,19,Fspill.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785246499
OL,3,CResponse to plastic pellet spill not
OL,4,C'met expectations', says shipping
OL,5,Ccompany
OL,7,FHe went on to say: "I recognise that
OL,8,Fthe pace of the initial mobilisation
OL,9,Fof specialist contractors has not met
OL,10,Fcommunity expectations".
OL,12,FThe CEO added: "Cadeler shares the
OL,13,Fview that time is of the essence, and
OL,14,Fwe are pleased to see that significant
OL,15,Fspecialist resources are now deployed."
OL,17,FAlthough not toxic, the public have
OL,18,Fbeen advised not to touch the nurdles
OL,19,Fif they spot them on a beach.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785246499
OL,3,CResponse to plastic pellet spill not
OL,4,C'met expectations', says shipping
OL,5,Ccompany
OL,7,FPeople are also being urged to keep
OL,8,Fdogs away from them, as they can be
OL,9,Fharmful to animals and wildlife if
OL,10,Fingested.
OL,12,FNorth East Mayor Kim McGuinness
OL,13,Fdescribed the spill as "devastating",
OL,14,Fadding that "this is probably one of
OL,15,Fthe biggest pollution incidents of
OL,16,Fthis sort in Europe".
OL,18,FShe added: "Now the clean-up job is
OL,19,Fseriously on, and it needs to be
OL,20,Fsustained right through until this is
OL,21,Fproperly resolved."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785246499
OL,3,CResponse to plastic pellet spill not
OL,4,C'met expectations', says shipping
OL,5,Ccompany
OL,7,FThe mayor was speaking just hours
OL,8,Fafter hundreds of volunteers armed
OL,9,Fwith brushes and sieves descended on
OL,10,FLongsands in Tynemouth to assist with
OL,11,Fthe clean-up.
OL,13,FThey were issued with safety equipment
OL,14,Fand advice as they worked to sift
OL,15,Fthrough the sand.
OL,17,FMeanwhile, South Tyneside Council said
OL,18,Fit is continuing to respond to reports
OL,19,Fof nurdles washing up on sections of
OL,20,Fthe authority's coastline.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785246499
OL,3,CResponse to plastic pellet spill not
OL,4,C'met expectations', says shipping
OL,5,Ccompany
OL,7,FIt said: "Council teams are monitoring
OL,8,Faffected locations and supporting a
OL,9,Fcoordinated clean-up operation with
OL,10,Fpartner organisations.
OL,12,F"We are working with the Environment
OL,13,FAgency, Maritime and Coastguard
OL,14,FAgency, Port of Tyne, neighbouring
OL,15,Flocal authorities, the Mayoral
OL,16,FStrategic Authority, specialist
OL,17,Fcontractors and other agencies to
OL,18,Fassess the extent of the contamination
OL,19,Fand support efforts to remove pellets
OL,20,Ffrom affected areas where appropriate.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,394,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1785246499
OL,3,CResponse to plastic pellet spill not
OL,4,C'met expectations', says shipping
OL,5,Ccompany
OL,7,F"Our priority is protecting the
OL,8,Fcoastline, supporting the multi-agency
OL,9,Fresponse and minimising any impact on
OL,10,Flocal wildlife and the wider
OL,11,Fenvironment."
OL,13,FCadeler and BG Freight Line have been
OL,14,Fcontacted for comment.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G8/8
